# Every text file in this repo has LF line endings on every OS. The Linux half
# runs under sh and awk, which cannot read CRLF, and the Windows clone that
# Publish-ManatechMotd.ps1 publishes from would otherwise be checked out as
# CRLF by Git's core.autocrlf. PowerShell reads LF files as well.
* text=auto eol=lf
